	<h1>Member Directory</h1>
</div></div>
			</div>
				<div class="iMIS-WebPart">
					<div id="ste_container_ciIntroblurb_f5f84af259cd410db80e6c21386f9894" class="ContentItemContainer"><div id="ctl01_TemplateBody_WebPartManager1_gwpciIntroblurb_f5f84af259cd410db80e6c21386f9894_ciIntroblurb_f5f84af259cd410db80e6c21386f9894_Panel_Introblurb">
	FIA brings together firms from across the global cleared derivatives ecosystem. Our Primary Members are clearing firms that hold customer funds, while our Associate Members include clearinghouses, exchanges, brokers, trading firms, technology providers and professional services companies. Together, they play a critical role in supporting liquid, resilient and well-functioning derivatives markets around the world. <a href="https://www.fia.org/fia/about-fia-membership">Learn more</a> about becoming an FIA member.
</div></div>
